  "prefLabel": "Arch 301.03 References Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 301.03 References Required. Each applicant for licensure shall arrange for the OPLC to receive a minimum of 5 references, at least 3 of which shall be provided by licensed architects having detailed knowledge of the applicant’s architecture experience.\n\nSource. #7944, eff 8-27-03; ss by #9097, eff 2-29-08; ss by #10904, eff 8-5-15; ss by #14553, eff 6-2-26, EXPIRES: 6-2-36",
